::: {.cell}

:::

9. Which __function__ can be used to create a __vector__? <div class='webex-radiogroup' id='radio_YTYIEAAQDU'><label><input type="radio" autocomplete="off" name="radio_YTYIEAAQDU" value="answer"></input> <span>`c()`</span></label><label><input type="radio" autocomplete="off" name="radio_YTYIEAAQDU" value=""></input> <span>`class()`</span></label><label><input type="radio" autocomplete="off" name="radio_YTYIEAAQDU" value=""></input> <span>`paste()`</span></label></div>



::: {.cell}

:::

